✅ What you need to do next

Now you just need to deploy the project.

1. Build your project (Vite React app)
cd ~/MyPortFolio
npm install
npm run build

👉 This will create a dist/ folder (your production website files)

2. Install Nginx (web server)
sudo apt update
sudo apt install nginx -y
3. Deploy your website to Nginx
sudo rm -rf /var/www/html/*
sudo cp -r dist/* /var/www/html/

Restart Nginx:

sudo systemctl restart nginx
4. Open your website in browser

